# packaging/common/deps.deb.bookworm -- runtime Depends for Debian 12 (bookworm).
# Same sonames as noble, different package names for the t64 transition and the older ffmpeg.
# ⚠️ Compatibility courtesy, not a promise (PLAN §8.1, risk R4): libavcodec.so.60 is dlopen'd by
# name from a guest wrapper, so on bookworm the dlopen fails even though libavcodec59 satisfies
# our Depends. The bookworm .deb is published only if G-VERIFY-3 passes.
libc6 (>= 2.36)
libstdc++6
libgcc-s1
libgl1
libegl1
libglu1-mesa
libvulkan1
# noble calls this libfuse2t64
libfuse2
libx11-6
libxext6
libxcursor1
libxrandr2
libxkbfile1
libcairo2
libfontconfig1
libfreetype6
# noble: libpng16-16t64
libpng16-16
# noble: libjpeg-turbo8
libjpeg62-turbo
libgif7
libtiff6
libpulse0
libdbus-1-3
libsystemd0
libcrypt1
# noble: libavcodec60 (ffmpeg 5.1 vs 6.x)
libavcodec59
libavformat59
libavutil57
libswresample3
xdg-utils
dbus
python3
